6280;1;%1: rxpdo %2 未接收到循环数据;No cyclic data received for RXPDO with quoted number. Cause may be module error or error on CAN-bus;Check connection to the device, state of the device and parametration of the PDOs. If this error message occures repeated try to increase the cycle time and/or baud rate. A CAN bus record may help to identify the detailed error reason.
